---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { andrea } from '../../lib/golf';
---
<Layout title="My Golf Passport — StickLink Golf" description="A connected golf passport for rounds, course badges, achievements, and collectible golf memories." eyebrow="GOLFER PASSPORT / DEMONSTRATION VIEW">
  <section class="page shell"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR PLAYING HISTORY, WITH A PHYSICAL HOME</div><h1>My Golf Passport</h1><p class="page-lead">Every course you play can leave something behind. Your passport keeps the record connected to the physical objects you carry.</p>
    <div class="source-note"><strong>DEMONSTRATION VIEW</strong><span>The Cedar Ridge history and identity shown here are illustrative product data. The persistent passport API is private and requires the matching verified State of Stick golfer identity.</span></div><div class="passport-banner"><img src="/art/golf-emblems.png" alt="Three original StickLink Golf collectible emblems" /><div><div class="eyebrow">PHYSICAL PASSPORT / CONNECTED OBJECT</div><h2>Your bag tag is the key.</h2><p>Tap a course emblem, tournament token, or your own StickLink to carry this history with you.</p></div></div><div class="passport-season-strip"><div><span>YOUR SEASON</span><b>5 rounds</b><small>3 courses · 1 active league</small></div><div><span>YOUR STATE</span><b>Michigan Four</b><small>47 courses in your history</small></div><div><span>NATIONAL STANDING</span><b>#01,248</b><small>Network participation · not a handicap</small></div><div><span>CURRENT STREAK</span><b>3 rounds</b><small>Keep the passport moving</small></div></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0"><a class="button secondary" href="/intelligence/">See your round intelligence ↗</a></p><div class="dashboard">
      <div class="panel"><h2>{andrea.name}'s passport</h2><div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><b>{andrea.rounds}</b><span>Rounds</span></div><div class="stat"><b>{andrea.coursesPlayed}</b><span>Courses</span></div><div class="stat"><b>{andrea.achievements}</b><span>Badges</span></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">↗</div><div><b>Cedar Ridge Golf Club</b><small>Round started · Today at 9:42 AM</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">✦</div><div><b>Unlocked: Michigan Four</b><small>Four connected courses played</small></div></div><div class="activity"><div class="activity-icon">◎</div><div><b>Northstar Invitational</b><small>Finished 3rd · July 28, 2026</small></div></div></div>
      <div class="panel"><h2>Collection <span style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:400">/ {andrea.achievements}</span></h2><div class="badge-grid"><div class="badge"><div class="medal">✦</div><span>Michigan Four</span></div><div class="badge"><div class="medal">◉</div><span>First Birdie</span></div><div class="badge"><div class="medal">♧</div><span>Member Guest</span></div><div class="badge"><div class="medal">⌁</div><span>Cedar Ridge</span></div><div class="badge muted"><div class="medal">?</div><span>Hole-in-one</span></div><div class="badge muted"><div class="medal">?</div><span>10 Courses</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
